  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Explore an AI Model - Layla\r\n**Goal:** See how this person's AI system turns input data into a decision.\r\n\r\n1. Read the **Input data** step: what the data is, how much there is and how fast it's needed.\r\n2. Press **Run model** and watch each step: **Input data**, **AI model**, **Output** and **Decision**.\r\n3. Turn on **Noisy input** and run the model again. Compare the confidence.\r\n\r\nThink about: Who makes the final decision? What happens when the data is noisy?\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "true",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "preview",
    "predict_settings": {
